DnHttp is original dn2cpp code: a thin managed transport swap for
System.Net.Http, forwarding an intercepted SocketsHttpHandler.Send /
SendAsync to dn2cpp's native libcurl-backed transport. Nothing here is
ported from or derived from another project, so — unlike its sibling
managed-swap libraries DnZlib and DnBrotli — it carries no upstream
notices and is licensed under the same terms as dn2cpp itself.

